silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_09_manifest_hom_profile_concrete_anchor_1#mittensvetrecordbackendtarget silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordBackendTarget is In section 'Manifest as Written Hom-Profile' the bare symbol Manifest anchors to MittensVetRecordBackendTarget: The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status." .
